# Soul carryover (life/mortal_banned.js, design/data/mortal_banned.toml, master plan §4). `ttl stash <bot> expect
# <field> <n>` prints "ttl: ..." when the count is wrong, which `server.sh test-all` counts as a failure.
# Setup: a Life 1 bot with 2 ender chest stacks, a backpack in a Curios slot, a soulbound-by-test stick and a Tensura
# potion (banned in the Mortal Realm). Expect in the log: "[ttl] TtlBotCarry (life 1) had 1 banned stacks, moved to
# the soul stash", "[ttl] TtlBotCarry Life 1 strip: 1 soulbound kept, 0 banned stashed, ender chest and Curios
# emptied", "[ttl] TtlBotCarry rebirth: 1 soulbound and 1 stashed stacks returned".
ttlbot spawn TtlBotCarry
@sleep 2
ttl stash TtlBotCarry clear
ttl stash TtlBotCarry soulbound minecraft:amethyst_shard
item replace entity TtlBotCarry enderchest.0 with minecraft:diamond 3
item replace entity TtlBotCarry enderchest.26 with minecraft:emerald 5
ttl stash TtlBotCarry equip sophisticatedbackpacks:backpack
give TtlBotCarry minecraft:amethyst_shard 3
give TtlBotCarry minecraft:bread 4
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect ender 2
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect curios 1
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect soul 1
# A banned Tensura item is moved into the soul stash (the manual sweep, or the 2 second loop if it ran first).
give TtlBotCarry tensura:low_potion 2
ttl stash TtlBotCarry sweep
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect banned 0
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect stash 1
# Life 1 death: ender chest and Curios are emptied, the soulbound stick is kept, the stash stays.
kill TtlBotCarry
@sleep 2
ttl inspect TtlBotCarry
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect ender 0
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect curios 0
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect kept 1
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect stash 1
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect soul 0
# Rebirth returns both: the shard and the potion are on the body, nothing else.
execute as TtlBotCarry run ttl wish knowledge
execute as TtlBotCarry run ttl choose slime
@sleep 1
ttl inspect TtlBotCarry
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect kept 0
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect stash 0
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect soul 1
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect banned 1
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect ender 0
ttl stash TtlBotCarry expect curios 0
# Life 2 is never swept: the potion stays in the inventory.
ttl stash TtlBotCarry clear
ttl reset TtlBotCarry
ttlbot remove TtlBotCarry
